      "item": "theoreticalsciences:stellar_plasma_crucible",
      "title": "Stellar Plasma Crucible",
      "text": "Melts and alloys matter in plasma as hot as a stellar core. Makes Chronosteel, Spacetime Alloy, Cosmic Neutronium and Exotic Solder.$(br2)$(thing)Tier 3$() machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Plasma is the fourth state of matter: gas so hot its electrons are stripped away. The Sun's core runs at about fifteen million kelvin. At that temperature, every metal I own is the same thing - a glowing soup waiting to be told what to become."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(thing)Made on the Extreme Assembly Table$() (it is also a crafting table). The recipe pages at the end of this entry - and JEI - show the pattern."
